BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:151551@moodle.innopolis.university
SUMMARY:Lo-Fi Prototype (Midterm) is due
DESCRIPTION: \n\nASSIGNMENT RUBRIC & DETAILS:\n\nhttps://www.notion.so/ulmo
	st/Project-Lo-Fi-Prototype-Midterm-5896ada5a3264160a8e3054113cf4ac5?pvs=4\n
	\nSUBMIT A FIGMA PAGE LINK THAT HAS FOLLOWING:\n\nA) Research Synthesis Sec
	tion\n\n- A.1 Interviews Notes Figma Frame\n- A.2 Themes and Opportunities
	(or Interview Synthesis) Figma Frame\n- A.3 Feature Ideation Figma Frame\n-
	 A.4 Feature Prioritization Figma Frame\n\nB) Rapid Prototyping Section\n\n
	- B.1 User Flow Figma Frame\n- B.2 Paper Sketches "Crazy 8's" Figma Frame\n
	- B.3 Digital Prototype Figma Frame\n\nExample:\nhttps://www.figma.com/file
	/k4xVgz0HDmpowrclYYXvcS/UX%2FUI-for-Startup-Course-Example-%22TevaLearn%22?
	type=design&node-id=184-2182&mode=design\n\nIMPORTANT NOTES FOR THIS PROJEC
	T SUBMISSION:\n\n	* Please ensure that at the end of each assignment\, you
	have a table including the contribution from each member of the group. (You
	 can attach the table as an "image/screenshot" in the same Figma Page)\nSee
	 the example via link: https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/13DJPUxVc4ZGX
	PzHq_RRy2vfEUm-2V06DqATVuiMEneo/edit?usp=sharing\n\n	* Make sure that links
	 to any submitted files have the sharing permission set to “Anyone with a l
	ink can View/Access” or your submission won't be graded.\n	* The Figma “pro
	ject” file should be organized logically and neatly.\n	* If you submitted l
	inks that lead to cloud/online files\, make sure that they're completed (no
	t just submitted\, which you will update later after the deadline)\n	* Late
	 Submission: You will be graded as a normal submission but then it will be
	degraded to the lower grade level.\n\n

CLASS:PUBLIC
LAST-MODIFIED:20260611T163047Z
DTSTAMP:20260708T173053Z
DTSTART:20260706T205900Z
DTEND:20260706T205900Z
CATEGORIES:[Sum26]UX/DesBs
END:VEVENT
