UID:151012@moodle.innopolis.university
SUMMARY:Videoessay about the scientist - срок сдачи
DESCRIPTION:Here you need to attach the link for YandexDisk with your video
	. Video about the scientist should reveal his/her role in the history of Ru
	ssian science. Check that you opened access to your file with the link you
	send.\n\nIt should be not less than 3 minutes and not more than 5 minutes.\
	n\nYou must be present in the frame\, but not necessarily all the time.\n\n
	You may use additional illustrations during your video\, in the end you hav
	e to say several words about the sources of your information for the video.
	\n

