BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:151171@moodle.innopolis.university
SUMMARY:Assignment 2 is due
DESCRIPTION:Create a 5–15 second animation of a long-abandoned toy factory
	coming back to life. Your focus is not on visual storytelling\, but on demo
	nstrating mastery of Blender’s animation and simulation tools.\n\nYour proj
	ect must include AT LEAST ONE MEANINGFUL USE OF EACH of the following techn
	iques:\n\n		FEATURE\n		REQUIREMENT\n\n		KEYFRAME ANIMATION\n		Animate at le
	ast 3 object properties (location\, rotation\, scale\, material)\n\n		NON-L
	INEAR ANIMATION\n		Combine at least 2 actions using the NLA editor or use A
	ction constraint\n\n		RIGGING\n		Use armatures or bone constraints for a mo
	ving machine or toy\n\n		RIGID BODY PHYSICS\n		Include a working simulation
	 with falling/moving physical parts\n\n		CLOTH PHYSICS\n		Use cloth on an o
	bject (e.g. tarp\, curtain\, banner) that reacts to forces\n\n		PARTICLE SY
	STEM\n		Use emitter or hair particles for factory effects (dust\, sparks\,
	fur\, etc.)\n\nGrading criteria:\n\n	* 5% Keyframe Animation\n	* Smooth\, b
	elievable use of keyframes with clean interpolation and curves\n\n	* 3% NLA
	 Animation\n	* Two or more actions correctly combined\, blended and timed\n
		* OR\n	* Action constraint used to control progress of a complex repeated
	sequence with a single keyframe channel.\n\n	* 3% Rigging\n	* Functional ri
	g setup\n	* correct parenting\n	* used constraints \n	* used in animation\n
	\n	* 3% Rigid Body Physics\n	* Accurate use of rigid bodies\, including col
	lision settings\n\n	* 3% Cloth Physics\n	* Cloth behaves believably\n	* Pin
	ned areas or weights used correctly\n\n	* 3% Particle System\n	* At least o
	ne particle system used \n	* Settings and forces used\n\n	* 2% Scene Manage
	ment\n	* Naming\, baking\, file organization\, and cleanliness of the scene
	\n\n	* 3% Playback Accuracy\n	* Scene plays correctly in rendered video and
	 Blender viewport\n\nPenalties (additive):\n\n	* Late submission: -50% (of
	the grade deserved for this assignment)\n	* Improper naming: -25% (of the g
	rade deserved for this assignment)\n\nAppend your (.BLEND file or .ZIP with
	 assets and bakes) and RENDERED ANIMATION\n\nNAME FILES %3D_HW2_Name_Surnam
	e.format% for example 3D_HW2_Egor_Dmitriev.blend\n\n

CLASS:PUBLIC
LAST-MODIFIED:20260708T125620Z
DTSTAMP:20260708T173053Z
DTSTART:20260714T205900Z
DTEND:20260714T205900Z
CATEGORIES:[Sum26]IntTo3DMod
END:VEVENT
