BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:151172@moodle.innopolis.university
SUMMARY:Term project: Dynamic Machines is due
DESCRIPTION:Create an animation as if you were participating in the\n\nFor
	the term project\, you only need to do one box and render it for the entire
	 duration (0-499 frames). \n\nThe camera motion is correct. Your box starts
	 out of sight and ends out of sight. DON'T TOUCH THE CAMERA and DON'T MOVE
	THE BOX BORDERS\n\nA ball should enter the box at frame 113 and a ball shou
	ld leave the box between frames 335-340. At those moments they have to be v
	isible and metallic. In between\, you can do anything\, even create more ba
	lls or remove the existing one.\n\nThe initial files are appended\n\nGradin
	g criteria: \n\n	* 10% Animation\nAnimation quality\n\n	* 10% Materials and
	 Lighting\nStyle consistency\nMaterial quality\nOverall look of the scene\n
	\n	* 10% Procedural generation\nMax grade for this category will be awarded
	 for good use of at least 2 tools from the following list: Physics\, Riggin
	g\, GeoNodes\, Particle systems\, Fluids\n\n	* 10% Creativity\n\n	* 5% Base
	 meshes\nNo overlapping geometry\nOverall quality of the models\n\n	* 5% Sc
	ene setup\nScene objects are named and arranged for easy work with them\nNo
	de Trees are arranged\, framed\, and grouped for easy understanding of thei
	r function\n\nSUBMIT 1 FILE:\n\n	* _%3D_TP_Name_Surname.blend%_ or _%3D_TP_
	Name_Surname.zip%_ for your PROJECT FILE or PROJECT ARCHIVE if you have use
	d assets from other files\n	* RENDER should go to https://moodle.innopolis.
	university/mod/assign/view.php?id=148951 [1]\n\n\n\nLinks:\n------\n[1] htt
	ps://moodle.innopolis.university/mod/assign/view.php?id=148951\n

CLASS:PUBLIC
LAST-MODIFIED:20260603T105344Z
DTSTAMP:20260708T173053Z
DTSTART:20260722T205900Z
DTEND:20260722T205900Z
CATEGORIES:[Sum26]IntTo3DMod
